WEBVTT

00:00:05.090 --> 00:00:08.220
Academia... Where are they hiding?

00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:13.360
We've had enough.

00:00:16.640 --> 00:00:21.610
Rise up! It's time to overturn 
this Tops-controlled world!

00:00:21.610 --> 00:00:24.560
Let's tear down this so-called equal society!

00:00:24.560 --> 00:00:28.540
Let's make our society truly equal!

00:00:28.830 --> 00:00:30.260
Revolution!

00:00:30.510 --> 00:00:34.510
Revolution! Revolution! Revolution!

00:00:34.950 --> 00:00:38.450
Commons are gathering in the GD111 area!

00:00:38.830 --> 00:00:42.880
Commons are destroying storefronts 
in the FV44 area.

00:00:42.880 --> 00:00:44.420
We can't keep up!

00:00:44.680 --> 00:00:47.260
Director, all areas report that the

00:00:47.260 --> 00:00:51.660
group believed to be Academia has 
completely withdrawn from City.

00:00:52.110 --> 00:00:53.640
They have given up?

00:00:54.910 --> 00:00:59.220
But the trump card, Yuzu Hiiragi, 
is already in my hands.

00:00:59.600 --> 00:01:00.800
Revolution!

00:01:00.970 --> 00:01:02.070
Revolution!

00:01:02.310 --> 00:01:03.290
Revolution!

00:01:03.470 --> 00:01:04.530
Revolution!

00:01:04.700 --> 00:01:05.760
Revolution!

00:01:05.910 --> 00:01:06.850
Revolution!

00:01:07.070 --> 00:01:08.010
Revolution!

00:01:08.010 --> 00:01:10.720
Mama! I'm scared!

00:01:12.280 --> 00:01:14.870
Hey, kid... It's okay.

00:01:15.860 --> 00:01:17.710
Even if our revolution succeeds,

00:01:17.710 --> 00:01:23.310
if Tops kids lose their homes and end up hating 
Commons, resentment will persist.

00:01:23.310 --> 00:01:27.020
This won't change anything!

00:01:28.950 --> 00:01:30.600
D-Wheels.

00:01:31.200 --> 00:01:34.780
Riding duels are fought while 
racing on these machines,

00:01:34.780 --> 00:01:36.480
which are an evolution of the duel disks.

00:01:36.480 --> 00:01:39.920
They combine speed and thrills for the ultimate show,

00:01:39.920 --> 00:01:42.070
a symbol of freedom to all.

00:03:16.170 --> 00:03:20.980
The Duel Machine of Destruction

00:03:27.650 --> 00:03:29.380
Get away from Layra!

00:03:33.250 --> 00:03:34.490
Sawatari...

00:03:34.800 --> 00:03:35.860
What's wrong?

00:03:36.930 --> 00:03:38.780
You're... Sora!

00:03:41.210 --> 00:03:42.250
Yuya!

00:03:43.760 --> 00:03:44.540
Hey!

00:03:46.100 --> 00:03:47.440
Gongenzaka...

00:03:47.750 --> 00:03:49.080
Are you all right?

00:03:49.080 --> 00:03:50.330
More or less.

00:03:50.330 --> 00:03:52.180
Did you do this?

00:03:52.180 --> 00:03:55.150
You and Academia?!

00:03:57.490 --> 00:03:58.280
Wait...

00:03:58.280 --> 00:03:59.580
He's got to pay!

00:04:02.360 --> 00:04:03.920
Layra?

00:04:03.920 --> 00:04:04.950
Sawatari...

00:04:05.840 --> 00:04:07.740
Right now, Sora's not our enemy.

00:04:07.740 --> 00:04:08.700
What?

00:04:09.730 --> 00:04:10.990
Revolution!

00:04:11.140 --> 00:04:12.030
Revolution!

00:04:12.300 --> 00:04:13.390
Revolution!

00:04:13.520 --> 00:04:14.520
Revolution!

00:04:14.750 --> 00:04:15.670
Revolution!

00:04:16.040 --> 00:04:19.140
Yuzu was taken by Sergey?

00:04:19.600 --> 00:04:22.110
Serena was sent away, too?

00:04:22.800 --> 00:04:23.750
I...

00:04:24.820 --> 00:04:27.430
Yuya!

00:04:29.430 --> 00:04:31.320
I couldn't protect Yuzu!

00:04:31.570 --> 00:04:34.680
But why did Sergey abduct Yuzu?

00:04:34.680 --> 00:04:39.490
It's possible that one of this world's 
higher-ups is connected to Academia.

00:04:39.790 --> 00:04:41.010
That's right...

00:04:41.010 --> 00:04:43.850
Roget was originally from Academia.

00:04:43.850 --> 00:04:49.870
But he's taken Yuzu hostage to try and fight 
Academia, and build his own kingdom here.

00:04:50.390 --> 00:04:53.610
He's using Yuzu as a bargaining chip, then?

00:04:54.560 --> 00:04:55.450
Layra...

00:04:56.520 --> 00:04:57.450
Sora...

00:04:58.210 --> 00:04:59.810
I'll get Yuzu back.

00:05:00.190 --> 00:05:02.280
Wait! I'll go, too!

00:05:02.280 --> 00:05:04.380
In your condition, you cannot.

00:05:04.380 --> 00:05:07.160
You're injured, too. You'd only hold me back.

00:05:07.160 --> 00:05:08.850
Do not underestimate the shinobi.

00:05:09.120 --> 00:05:09.960
Hey!

00:05:10.800 --> 00:05:12.790
Are you using this to run out on us?

00:05:13.050 --> 00:05:14.230
Sawatari!

00:05:15.440 --> 00:05:19.330
If Yuya says Sora isn't our 
enemy, then I trust him.

00:05:26.590 --> 00:05:27.500
I'm coming, too—

00:05:28.280 --> 00:05:29.210
Yuya!

00:05:32.240 --> 00:05:33.180
Yuzu...

00:05:34.370 --> 00:05:36.750
The Commons are heading for City's center.

00:05:37.250 --> 00:05:41.490
Activate security systems at the Public 
Order Bureau and the Duel Palace.

00:05:41.840 --> 00:05:46.960
Open all gates to the Duel Palace, 
to admit the fleeing Tops.

00:05:47.320 --> 00:05:50.380
But do not let a single Commons in.

00:05:50.380 --> 00:05:51.430
Understood.

00:05:51.720 --> 00:05:53.770
Then contact the Duel Palace.

00:05:54.480 --> 00:05:58.330
For the second match of the semifinals, 
we shall have a card change.

00:06:07.450 --> 00:06:08.910
Hey, are you serious?

00:06:08.910 --> 00:06:13.070
Are we really gonna continue the 
tournament like this? No way!

00:06:13.070 --> 00:06:13.920
We're live!

00:06:16.080 --> 00:06:18.330
Hi there, everyone!

00:06:18.330 --> 00:06:20.080
It's the Friendship Cup's fourth day.

00:06:20.080 --> 00:06:22.760
Time for the second semifinal match!

00:06:23.040 --> 00:06:27.360
Let me see... Things are pretty chaotic outside,

00:06:27.360 --> 00:06:31.390
but the Duel Palace has an
 impregnable security system.

00:06:31.390 --> 00:06:34.210
Please enjoy the duel, without fear.

00:06:34.660 --> 00:06:39.950
Today's semifinals will have 
an incredible surprise!

00:06:40.870 --> 00:06:44.050
Continuing the tournament under 
these conditions? It's ridiculous!

00:06:45.950 --> 00:06:48.080
Today's second semifinal match

00:06:48.080 --> 00:06:51.640
was supposed to be Hugo versus Sergey.

00:06:51.640 --> 00:06:55.390
But Hugo has dropped out, 
so we're changing the draw.

00:06:56.080 --> 00:06:57.600
Dropped out?

00:06:57.600 --> 00:07:02.010
In Hugo's place, facing Sergey will be... this man!

00:07:02.010 --> 00:07:05.770
City's biggest star, Jack Atlas!

00:07:08.630 --> 00:07:09.970
Jack?

00:07:12.220 --> 00:07:14.220
We get to see Jack duel?

00:07:14.220 --> 00:07:15.650
That is a surprise!

00:07:15.930 --> 00:07:18.720
That's right... Let's get hyped!

00:07:19.360 --> 00:07:21.160
Do forgive me.

00:07:21.160 --> 00:07:23.870
Asking you for something, without prior approval.

00:07:23.870 --> 00:07:24.840
I don't mind.

00:07:24.840 --> 00:07:27.690
No matter the situation, I accept the duel.

00:07:28.150 --> 00:07:29.590
That is what it means to be king.

00:07:30.520 --> 00:07:31.960
Good luck.

00:07:35.870 --> 00:07:38.510
Well, well... Welcome.

00:07:38.510 --> 00:07:41.210
The semifinals are about to start.

00:07:41.210 --> 00:07:43.000
This isn't the time for that.

00:07:43.000 --> 00:07:44.840
The Commons are rioting out there.

00:07:44.840 --> 00:07:46.580
Soon enough, they will settle down.

00:07:47.880 --> 00:07:51.720
The duel between Sergey and 
Jack will see to that.

00:07:51.720 --> 00:07:52.820
What do you mean?

00:07:53.140 --> 00:07:57.790
Jack Atlas is the star of hope, 
for both Tops and Commons.

00:07:58.230 --> 00:08:01.480
That hope will be crushed during 
his duel with Sergey.

00:08:02.640 --> 00:08:07.150
When the hopes of both Tops and Commons 
are crushed into nothing,

00:08:07.150 --> 00:08:10.740
City will be plunged into the depths of despair.

00:08:11.000 --> 00:08:15.210
And the history of City, of this 
dimension, will change.

00:08:23.310 --> 00:08:24.310
Um...

00:08:25.300 --> 00:08:26.780
Do you remember me?

00:08:29.170 --> 00:08:33.850
Before... You gave me the 
Tuning Magician card.

00:08:35.140 --> 00:08:38.800
I thought you were saying I 
was like a worthless card.

00:08:38.800 --> 00:08:40.730
I hated you for that.

00:08:41.360 --> 00:08:44.680
I gave that card to Yuya,

00:08:44.680 --> 00:08:46.940
and asked him to throw it in your face.

00:08:47.200 --> 00:08:48.270
Yuya?

00:08:48.270 --> 00:08:49.800
Yuya Sakaki?

00:08:51.520 --> 00:08:53.510
But Yuya showed me...

00:08:54.080 --> 00:08:57.020
That if you use it right, it can be a great card.

00:08:57.020 --> 00:08:59.120
That there's no such thing as a useless card.

00:08:59.680 --> 00:09:02.670
All cards have their role.

00:09:03.340 --> 00:09:04.790
The same goes for people.

00:09:06.350 --> 00:09:10.420
You have yours. Yuya Sakaki has his.

00:09:10.850 --> 00:09:12.560
And I have mine.

00:09:12.560 --> 00:09:13.370
Right.

00:09:14.210 --> 00:09:16.170
Tell Yuya Sakaki...

00:09:17.740 --> 00:09:21.020
Sergey is first on the field.

00:09:21.710 --> 00:09:24.680
The merciless duelist, who took out Yuzu.

00:09:24.680 --> 00:09:26.120
And his opponent...

00:09:26.120 --> 00:09:28.670
City's hope, its legend.

00:09:28.670 --> 00:09:32.350
The star that shines in the heavens of City!

00:09:32.740 --> 00:09:33.550
Your,

00:09:33.550 --> 00:09:34.790
and your,

00:09:34.790 --> 00:09:36.540
and my,

00:09:36.540 --> 00:09:38.520
and our...

00:09:38.520 --> 00:09:42.410
Jack Atlas!

00:09:57.660 --> 00:10:00.550
There is but one king! And that is I!

00:10:02.510 --> 00:10:06.220
Yes, cheer... Cheer for your hope.

00:10:06.220 --> 00:10:08.330
And the despair that lies beyond

00:10:08.960 --> 00:10:12.240
will be prologue to a new hope.

00:10:12.240 --> 00:10:13.690
A new hope?

00:10:13.960 --> 00:10:17.160
Just watch King fall.

00:10:17.560 --> 00:10:20.130
Exactly what are you planning?

00:10:27.390 --> 00:10:31.660
Jack! Jack! Jack! Jack!

00:10:31.660 --> 00:10:35.880
Well, it's a hastily improvised match, 
but the duelists are two to watch!

00:10:35.880 --> 00:10:38.940
Now, Action Field, on.

00:10:38.940 --> 00:10:40.750
Crossover Acceleration!

00:10:42.760 --> 00:10:44.360
Duel mode, on.

00:10:44.690 --> 00:10:46.860
Autopilot, stand by.

00:10:51.960 --> 00:10:56.190
Riding duel... Acceleration!

00:10:57.040 --> 00:10:57.930
Duel!

00:10:59.080 --> 00:11:02.810
Jack is first out the gate. He takes the first turn!

00:11:03.150 --> 00:11:08.310
My turn. I summon Tuner 
Monster Red Resonator.

00:11:08.850 --> 00:11:12.280
When I summon a Red monster 
to my side of the field,

00:11:12.570 --> 00:11:16.990
I can Special Summon Red Warg from 
my hand, with its attack points halved.

00:11:20.280 --> 00:11:25.400
Level 6 Red Warg tunes Level 2 Red Resonator.

00:11:26.870 --> 00:11:30.130
The cry of the champion shakes 
heaven and earth.

00:11:30.130 --> 00:11:33.910
Let the unique power of the conqueror 
be carved into your body!

00:11:34.370 --> 00:11:35.840
Synchro Summon.

00:11:36.560 --> 00:11:38.180
The raging soul...

00:11:38.180 --> 00:11:40.920
Scarlight Red Dragon Archfiend!

00:11:42.420 --> 00:11:44.120
There it is!

00:11:44.120 --> 00:11:47.850
The king, Jack Atlas, has his 
ace monster out already!

00:11:48.140 --> 00:11:51.060
I set one card and end my turn!

00:11:53.290 --> 00:11:55.490
Take your turn, and advance my ideal.

00:11:55.770 --> 00:11:56.960
My turn!

00:11:57.720 --> 00:11:59.880
When a Field Spell is activated,

00:11:59.880 --> 00:12:04.170
I can Special Summon Earthbound 
Prisoner Stone Sweeper.

00:12:07.920 --> 00:12:13.180
Then, I summon Tuner Monster Earthbound 
Prisoner Line Walker!

00:12:16.910 --> 00:12:22.190
And I also activate my spell card Harmonic 
Synchro Fusion, from my hand.

00:12:22.610 --> 00:12:26.220
Its effect allows me to perform 
Synchro and Fusion Summons,

00:12:26.220 --> 00:12:30.390
between two component monsters 
on the field, simultaneously.

00:12:30.640 --> 00:12:35.980
Incredible! Sergey declares he will Synchro 
and Fusion Summon at the same time!

00:12:37.180 --> 00:12:42.570
Level 3 Line Walker tunes 
Level 5 Stone Sweeper.

00:12:42.960 --> 00:12:45.180
From deep within the ground, be reborn,

00:12:45.180 --> 00:12:47.980
giant beast with wings that deal out punishment!

00:12:49.640 --> 00:12:51.220
Synchro Summon!

00:12:51.720 --> 00:12:57.590
Appear, Level 8 Earthbound 
Servant Geo Gryphon.

00:13:01.480 --> 00:13:05.770
And I fuse Stone Sweeper and Line Walker.

00:13:06.200 --> 00:13:08.250
Prisoner who crawls along the ground,

00:13:08.250 --> 00:13:12.140
become one with the prisoner who 
walks the road to the gallows.

00:13:12.140 --> 00:13:14.470
Become the giant beast who 
deals out punishment!

00:13:15.390 --> 00:13:16.770
Fusion Summon!

00:13:17.130 --> 00:13:22.250
Appear, Level 8 Earthbound 
Servant Geo Kraken!

00:13:23.000 --> 00:13:27.920
Incredible! Sergey completes simultaneous 
Synchro and Fusion Summons!

00:13:29.930 --> 00:13:32.870
I activate the effect of Line 
Walker in my graveyard.

00:13:32.870 --> 00:13:36.990
I can banish this card to treat Red Dragon Archfiend

00:13:36.990 --> 00:13:40.700
as if it were just Special Summoned!

00:13:40.950 --> 00:13:45.400
Red Dragon, Special Summoned again? 
What does it mean?

00:13:45.720 --> 00:13:48.110
I activate Geo Kraken's effect.

00:13:48.360 --> 00:13:52.780
When a monster on your side of the field 
is Special Summoned during my turn,

00:13:52.780 --> 00:13:58.350
I destroy all such monsters. And for each, 
I deal you 800 damage.

00:13:58.640 --> 00:14:03.050
R-Right... He treated Jack's monster 
as if it were Special Summoned,

00:14:03.050 --> 00:14:06.590
so it could be destroyed by Geo Kraken's effect.

00:14:06.910 --> 00:14:10.120
If he takes direct attacks from both of those,

00:14:10.120 --> 00:14:12.300
Jack's gonna be in big trouble!

00:14:17.500 --> 00:14:19.700
You simply were not good enough.

00:14:22.670 --> 00:14:26.910
What? Jack's Red Dragon wasn't destroyed!

00:14:28.880 --> 00:14:31.980
I activated Action Spell Detour.

00:14:32.590 --> 00:14:35.320
I negate the activation of one 
of your monster effects,

00:14:35.320 --> 00:14:37.560
and deal 500 damage to you!

00:14:40.260 --> 00:14:44.730
Magnificent... Jack didn't just 
dodge Sergey's effect.

00:14:44.730 --> 00:14:47.080
He actually dealt damage to him!

00:14:48.960 --> 00:14:52.800
Yes, I was hoping you would put up some fight.

00:14:52.800 --> 00:14:55.190
After all, you are the king of hope.

00:14:56.240 --> 00:14:59.480
I set one card and end my turn.

00:15:02.250 --> 00:15:04.440
That's our Jack!

00:15:04.440 --> 00:15:06.950
He was just saved by the Action Card.

00:15:08.920 --> 00:15:11.160
Yuya, don't force it.

00:15:11.160 --> 00:15:14.390
Roget's trying to take over City.

00:15:14.390 --> 00:15:17.470
Yuzu probably needs help.

00:15:17.470 --> 00:15:19.100
I don't have time to sit around here!

00:15:20.200 --> 00:15:22.070
I suppose I can't stop you.

00:15:22.070 --> 00:15:25.140
This man, Gongenzaka, will accompany you.

00:15:26.720 --> 00:15:28.110
No!

00:15:28.110 --> 00:15:28.960
Layra...

00:15:28.960 --> 00:15:30.460
Don't leave me.

00:15:31.270 --> 00:15:35.280
Layra, you stay here with 
Mr. Tokumatsu and Sawatari.

00:15:35.550 --> 00:15:37.770
Huh? Wait a minute!

00:15:37.770 --> 00:15:40.010
Mr. Tokumatsu, take care of Layra.

00:15:40.010 --> 00:15:40.760
Sure.

00:15:40.760 --> 00:15:43.520
Wait a minute! Why am I being left behind?

00:15:43.520 --> 00:15:44.640
Sawatari!

00:15:44.640 --> 00:15:47.360
What, you're going to give me orders?

00:15:47.360 --> 00:15:51.500
Please... Please protect Layra!

00:15:51.830 --> 00:15:53.290
Sawa, boy...

00:15:53.290 --> 00:15:54.970
What, old man?

00:15:54.970 --> 00:15:59.230
The one to protect the precious little 
brother of the Lancers' leader

00:15:59.230 --> 00:16:02.670
must be the man closest to being that leader.

00:16:02.960 --> 00:16:04.140
Am I wrong?

00:16:06.110 --> 00:16:07.230
I get it!

00:16:07.230 --> 00:16:11.280
So it's something only I, with the potential 
to be the next leader, could handle?

00:16:11.280 --> 00:16:12.950
That's right.

00:16:13.200 --> 00:16:18.170
Yuya, as next leader, I take on this job.

00:16:18.170 --> 00:16:18.920
Go on.

00:16:19.240 --> 00:16:21.190
Thanks, I'm counting on you!

00:16:22.800 --> 00:16:24.220
Yuya!

00:16:24.220 --> 00:16:27.500
Don't worry. You'll stay with us.

00:16:27.500 --> 00:16:31.770
Layra, if you wish, you may call me "big brother."

00:16:32.770 --> 00:16:36.060
Well, maybe I'll try it once, 
if I feel like it.

00:16:39.630 --> 00:16:40.900
My turn!

00:16:41.500 --> 00:16:44.600
I activate Scarlight Red 
Dragon Archfiend's effect.

00:16:44.600 --> 00:16:45.930
Once per turn,

00:16:45.930 --> 00:16:50.600
it can destroy all Special Summoned monsters 
with fewer attack points than its own,

00:16:50.600 --> 00:16:55.190
dealing 500 damage to you for each!

00:16:55.680 --> 00:16:58.330
Absolute Power Flame!

00:17:17.210 --> 00:17:21.190
Sergey went to grab an Action Card, 
but didn't activate it!

00:17:21.450 --> 00:17:27.160
When an Earthbound monster is destroyed, 
Geo Gryphon destroys one of your monsters!

00:17:27.940 --> 00:17:31.460
I send Red Gardna from my hand to 
the graveyard, to activate its effect!

00:17:32.070 --> 00:17:36.570
This turn, monsters on my side of the field
 cannot be destroyed by card effects!

00:17:36.570 --> 00:17:39.720
Sergey dishes it out, and Jack dodges it!

00:17:39.720 --> 00:17:41.540
Jack remains in the lead!

00:17:41.800 --> 00:17:46.430
Battle! I attack directly with Scarlight 
Red Dragon Archfiend!

00:17:46.430 --> 00:17:49.800
Red Hot Crimson Hell Burning!

00:17:50.980 --> 00:17:54.450
I activate my Counter Trap 
Earthbound Beginnings!

00:17:54.760 --> 00:18:00.420
When my life is 3000 or below, I halve 
the damage dealt by direct attacks.

00:18:03.190 --> 00:18:07.600
And I can select one Field Spell 
from my deck and activate it!

00:18:07.930 --> 00:18:10.570
I activate my Field Spell Earthbound Tundra!

00:18:17.080 --> 00:18:21.250
When I have an Action Card in my hand, 
I can pick up another Action Card.

00:18:21.250 --> 00:18:24.750
What? You should only be able 
to carry one Action Card,

00:18:24.750 --> 00:18:26.220
but he can pick up another?

00:18:26.220 --> 00:18:31.840
Then, the Action Card I picked up is banished, 
300 damage is dealt to you,

00:18:31.840 --> 00:18:35.430
and the attack points of one of your 
monsters is reduced by 300.

00:18:36.240 --> 00:18:39.470
Dealing damage to an opponent, 
just by grabbing an Action Card?

00:18:39.470 --> 00:18:40.490
I see.

00:18:41.200 --> 00:18:43.870
But Field Spells apply to both sides.

00:18:44.270 --> 00:18:46.840
I'm riding in front, and if I grab an Action Card,

00:18:46.840 --> 00:18:50.340
your card's effect will be turned back on you!

00:18:55.680 --> 00:18:57.520
Now, it truly begins.

00:19:14.610 --> 00:19:15.970
What? What's going on?

00:19:42.190 --> 00:19:44.930
I have become one with speed.

00:19:47.430 --> 00:19:50.400
Behold my beautiful form!

00:19:53.370 --> 00:19:54.840
How tasteless.

00:19:57.070 --> 00:20:00.920
Earthbound Tundra's effect lets 
me banish an Action Card!

00:20:01.570 --> 00:20:04.420
Take 300 points of damage!

00:20:04.820 --> 00:20:09.520
And Red Dragon's attack points 
decrease by 300.

00:20:10.040 --> 00:20:12.880
You plan to shave down Red 
Dragon's attack points?

00:20:12.880 --> 00:20:14.260
Nonsense.

00:20:14.790 --> 00:20:18.260
But there are still many more Action Cards...

00:20:20.700 --> 00:20:23.680
The Action Cards that saved you before

00:20:23.680 --> 00:20:25.900
now become the greatest threat to you.

00:20:25.900 --> 00:20:28.120
Yes, that is good.

00:20:28.120 --> 00:20:31.640
Let despair gradually take you, King.

00:20:31.890 --> 00:20:35.880
Foolish citizens, your light of hope 
will soon be snuffed out.

00:20:39.010 --> 00:20:41.520
Sergey transforms and takes the advantage

00:20:41.520 --> 00:20:44.520
with an Earthbound Tundra combo!

00:20:44.880 --> 00:20:47.490
Sergey? What is he...

00:20:47.790 --> 00:20:51.200
The semifinals have been blown wide open!

00:20:51.800 --> 00:20:54.130
Is he human?

00:20:54.130 --> 00:20:58.350
He is... Yes, the ultimate, living duel machine.

00:20:58.350 --> 00:21:00.100
Living duel machine?

00:21:00.610 --> 00:21:03.280
Brutality and precision combined,

00:21:03.280 --> 00:21:06.400
a duel machine that lives only for victory.

00:21:06.400 --> 00:21:09.080
He stands no chance of losing.

00:21:09.450 --> 00:21:12.550
The trump card to make my ideal a reality.

00:21:20.190 --> 00:21:23.020
Too slow, too slow, too slow, 
too slow, too slow!

00:21:23.020 --> 00:21:26.320
You'll never get ahead of me again.

00:21:26.320 --> 00:21:28.870
And you'll die an ugly death!

00:21:29.120 --> 00:21:31.560
Herald, who rides before the king,

00:21:32.150 --> 00:21:35.840
do not presume to think that a mere 
front-line soldier can defeat me!

00:21:35.840 --> 00:21:39.200
After your hope is shattered, you will learn

00:21:39.200 --> 00:21:41.550
the greatness of those with power.

00:21:42.360 --> 00:21:46.150
Soon, the people of City will bow before me...

00:21:46.150 --> 00:21:47.400
Then,

00:21:47.400 --> 00:21:52.460
your goal is to have Sergey beat Jack, 
so you can take control of City?

00:21:52.780 --> 00:21:59.160
True order can only be created 
by those with power.

00:22:06.210 --> 00:22:07.480
No.

00:23:50.240 --> 00:23:52.880
King, it's time to suffer.

00:23:52.880 --> 00:23:54.010
Suffer?

00:23:54.010 --> 00:23:55.800
Will the effect of Geo Gryphon

00:23:55.800 --> 00:24:00.220
destroy Scarlight Red Dragon Archfiend or not?

00:24:00.540 --> 00:24:03.290
You must choose.

00:24:03.290 --> 00:24:04.660
Fool...

00:24:04.660 --> 00:24:08.230
You think I'd throw away my soul, 
just because you challenge me?

00:24:09.990 --> 00:24:13.900
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ARC-V: 
Soul Fist.

00:24:14.320 --> 00:24:15.900
The fun is only getting started!
